  "text12": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "lead",
     "fontSize": 20
    },
    "text": "Two years ago every service owned its own broker. Last quarter we retired all of them. Here is what broke, what held, and what we would do differently."
   }
  },
  "text13": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "heading2",
     "fontSize": 28,
     "fontWeight": 700
    },
    "text": "Why we stopped running forty brokers"
   }
  },
  "text14": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "Each team had picked the queue that fit its first use case. That was fine until an incident crossed three of them: nobody could say where a message was, which retry policy applied, or who was paged. Operating forty small brokers cost us more than any one big one ever would.",
    "style": {
     "from": "body",
     "fontSize": 17
    }
   }
  },
  "text15": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "We started by inventorying every producer and consumer. The surprise was not the variety of technology but the sameness of the needs: at-least-once delivery, a dead-letter path, and visibility into lag.",
    "style": {
     "from": "body",
     "fontSize": 17
    }
   }
  },
  "row8": {
   "type": "row",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "spacing": 16,
    "crossAxisAlignment": "center"
   },
   "children": [
    "column7",
    "text16"
   ]
  },
  "column7": {
   "type": "column",
   "layout": {
    "width": 4,
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "crossAxisAlignment": "start"
   },
   "decoration": {
    "fills": [
     {
      "color": "#FF3B5BDB"
     }
    ],
    "radius": 2
   }
  },
  "text16": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "squeezable": true,
    "width": {
     "hug": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "The best migration plan is the one that lets you stop halfway and still be better off.",
    "style": {
     "from": "body",
     "fontSize": 24,
     "fontWeight": 600,
     "color": "primaryText"
    }
   }
  },
  "text17": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "heading2",
     "fontSize": 28,
     "fontWeight": 700
    },
    "text": "Making the move boring"
   }
  },
  "text18": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "We moved one consumer group at a time behind a thin client library. Producers wrote to both systems during the overlap, and a checker compared the two streams until they agreed for a full week.",
    "style": {
     "from": "body",
     "fontSize": 17
    }
   }
  },
